[00:04.920]Smile.
[00:08.635]This won’t hurt.
[00:10.664]You asked for this.
[00:12.298]I know what you’re thinking
[00:13.787]I’ve heard it before
[00:15.47]You want the shortcut
[00:16.395]You want a little more
[00:17.701]I sell it in mirrors
[00:18.957]I wrap it in light
[00:20.214]Safe little answers
[00:21.512]That feel just right
[00:23.24]They call me fake
[00:24.427]Like that’s an insult
[00:25.689]Baby, I survive
[00:27.89]I know the result
[00:28.592]Say it slower
[00:30.38]Say it sweet
[00:31.258]Truth goes down
[00:32.111]When it’s easy to eat
[00:34.104]Play nice
[00:34.759]Stay pretty
[00:35.412]Don’t shake the glass
[00:36.767]Don’t ask too many questions
[00:39.426]Play nice
[00:40.77]Stay ready
[00:40.774]If you want a place
[00:42.125]Learn the rules
[00:43.337]Learn the lesson
[00:44.972]Play nice
[00:49.887]Smile wider
[00:51.684]This is how you win
[00:53.120]Without getting dirty
[00:54.780]♫
[00:59.605]You think control looks ugly
[01:01.190]You think it wears a mask
[01:02.313]But power loves good lighting
[01:03.480]And a question you won’t ask
[01:04.903]I don’t raise my voice
[01:06.164]I don’t need to
[01:07.446]I let the silence
[01:08.285]Do what it’s told to
[01:09.810]Everybody wants the spotlight
[01:11.140]Nobody wants the cost
[01:12.449]I just explain the terms
[01:13.570]Before you get lost
[01:16.565]You call it fear
[01:17.898]I call it structure
[01:19.114]You call it cold
[01:20.283]I call it culture
[01:27.390]Play nice
[01:28.87]Stay quiet
[01:29.90]If it hurts
[01:30.30]You’re doing it right
[01:32.684]Play nice
[01:33.434]Stay shiny
[01:34.180]If you bend a little
[01:35.496]You’ll survive the night
[01:38.255]Play nice
[01:38.770]Be grateful
[01:39.752]This is how you stay
[01:43.638]Alive inside the frame
[01:51.879]I never said I cared
[01:55.479]I said I understood
[01:56.978]There’s a difference
[01:58.86]You should learn it
[01:59.100]If you could
[02:01.389]I don’t break dolls
[02:03.293]I replace them
[02:04.832]That’s mercy
[02:06.193]In a better dress
[02:11.720]Look at me
[02:12.330]Still standing
[02:13.320]Still chosen
[02:15.180]Still clean
[02:16.07]You hate me
[02:16.587]Because it works
[02:18.30]Play nice
[02:18.713]Stay useful
[02:19.462]You’ll thank me
[02:20.347]In the end
[02:23.519]Play nice
[02:24.78]Stay neutral
[02:24.828]This is how
[02:25.390]You keep your friends
[02:28.650]Stay nice
[02:29.462]Stay breathing
[02:30.462]This isn’t cruelty
[02:34.20]It’s design
[02:42.510]If you’re still here
[02:43.422]You’re doing great.
[02:44.509]♫
[02:48.210]Smile.
[02:49.121]♫
[02:52.470]We’re watching.